🔧 Usage Instructions:

Single Processing: Upload individual images in the Home tab
Batch Processing: Select multiple files in the Batch Processing tab
Auto Monitoring: Set up a folder path in Auto Monitor tab and start monitoring
Database: View all processed records, export to Excel, manage data
Analytics: Explore statistical insights from your processed data
Settings: Configure system parameters for optimal performance

